(789, 1, 81, 'Spirit of Shilen', 'skill0789', 'Receives the will of Shilen to drastically increase the fighting ability of party members. For 1 minute, increases P. Atk. by 30%, moving speed by 30, Atk. Spd. by 30%, the critical rate when a sword is equipped by 100, and the critical impact when a blunt weapon is equipped by 100%. Recovers as HP 40% of general close rate physical damage inflicted on the enemy. Decreases the power of received HP recovery magic by 80%.', 2, 0, 0, 1253, -2, 1799, 0, 0, '', 75000),
