(4416, 1, 0, 'Undead', 'skill4290', 'Called out of their graves by black magic, a curse or the power of an evil mind, most of these creatures lack intelligence and can perform only simple actions. However, some high-ranking undead possess great knowledge and sophistication even when compared to ordinary humanoids.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 2, 0, 'Magic Creatures', 'skill4291', 'The common name for the biotechnological items of the Magic and Titan Ages. Their M. Atk. is generally strong and they sometimes use high-level magic, such as teleportation.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 3, 0, 'Beasts', 'skill4292', 'They are animals who prey on humanoids for food. Some of them are mythological creatures that existed before the origins of humanity.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 4, 0, 'Animals', 'skill4293', 'These general animals are hunted by humanoids. They sometimes attack humanoids, but only to defend themselves or their territory.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 5, 0, 'Plants', 'skill4294', 'These consist of trees, grasses, mushrooms, and fungi. Instinctual creatures, it is generally impossible to have a conversation with them.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 6, 0, 'Humanoids', 'skill4295', 'They have two arms, two legs, and they walk upright. Culture and communal life varies by race.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 7, 0, 'Spirits', 'skill4296', 'They are not necessarily creatures, but elemental energy beings.  They basically belong to the 4 elements, which are water, fire, wind, and earth, but they also dwell in natural objects. They are known to be governed by the gods of water, fire, wind, and earth.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 8, 0, 'Angels', 'skill4297', 'These creatures of the heavenly realm or the race posses sacred blessings and were originally creatures of the spirits of light. In some very rare cases, angels can manifest the gods\' will in reality.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 9, 0, 'Demons', 'skill4298', 'This race of darkness opposes the angels. Beings that are changed by the curse of darkness become demons as well.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 10, 0, 'Dragons', 'skill4299', 'This word refers to True Dragon that is the most powerful and represents evil creatures Shilen gave birth to and its kinds.  Most of this race flies with two wings like reptiles and emits strong energy through its mouth.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 11, 0, 'Giants', 'skill4300', 'This race looks similar to a humanoid, but they are approximately 2-3 times in size. This includes the ancient Giants who once ruled the continent, their descendants, and even the monsters that have regressed and in whom only a small fragment of the race\'s history remains.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 12, 0, 'Bugs', 'skill4301', 'They consist of insects, spiders and worms and act upon their highly refined instincts. Sometimes their instincts present themselves in a more developed form than that of humanoid society.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 13, 0, 'Fairies', 'skill4302', 'Many members of this ancient race left our world as it changed to become more hostile. Some scholars theorize that Fairies were actually living works of art created by the gods for their entertainment.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 14, 0, 'Humans', 'skill4416_human', 'The last race created by the gods, Humans won the race war for domination of the entire world. Their strong desire for domination is perhaps fueled by the fact that their life span is the shortest among all the races.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 15, 0, 'Elves', 'skill4416_elf', 'This water race worships Eva and love peace. They possess vast knowledge, but lack the will and strength to implement it. The original students of magic, they have since taught its principles to humans.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 16, 0, 'Dark Elves', 'skill4416_darkelf', 'These Elves formed an alliance long ago and dedicated themselves to understanding the dark arts which were forbidden by their kin.  Gradually they became darker in their appearance and personality as generations passed. They are now adept in the practice and usage of black magic and continue to worship Shilen as their God.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 17, 0, 'Orcs', 'skill4416_orc', 'Created by Pa\'agrio, the Orcs are the physically strongest of all the races. They worship the spirits of the past and have a very tribal culture.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 18, 0, 'Dwarves', 'skill4416_dwarf', 'Although unable to use magic, Dwarves are strong and good with their hands.  They have sharp eyes and intelligent minds. Their business savvy is impressive, and they sometimes invent strange mechanical devices.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 19, 0, 'Others', 'skill4416_etc', '', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 20, 0, 'Non-living Beings', 'skill4416_none', '', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 21, 0, 'Siege Weapons', 'skill4416_siegeweapon', 'These massive Dwarf-made weapons are built to besiege castles.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 22, 0, 'Defending Army', 'skill4416_castleguard', 'The soldiers hired to protect castles; normally hired by a lord.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 23, 0, 'Mercenaries', 'skill4416_mercenary', 'The soldiers hired to attack castles; normally hired by a lord with payment.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 24, 0, 'Unknown Creature', 'skill4416_none', 'An unknown life form that has never been discovered before.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(4416, 25, 0, 'Kamael', 'skill4296', 'Battle race who have been sealed for a long time, and their origin is unknown. Their military-like classes and unique battle abilities cannot be copied by other races.', 13, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
