(5469, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 22', 'skillraid', 'Past the secure entrance to this large cavern waits Mother Nornil, the ruler of Nornil\'s Garden.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(5470, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 81', 'skillraid', 'This cruel, soulless woman handled much of Beleth\'s dirty work. Her wickedness became even more pronounced after Kechi, the object of her affection, aspired unsuccessfully to become Chief Guard.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(5471, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 82', 'skillraid', 'Kechi aspired to be the Chief Guard of the Crystal Caverns, but Beleth bypassed him in favor of Barler. Furious at the slight, Kechi plots his revenge.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(5472, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 83', 'skillraid', 'Originally a handmaiden for Parme within the order of Fafurion, her mind was infected by the seed of evil scattered by Beleth, and she is under his control.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(5473, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 81', 'skillraid', 'This once-noble soul was originally a powerful seer able to communicate directly with the divine; now only his overwhelming hatred against Beleth remains.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(5474, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 81', 'skillraid', 'This supernatural wind tore through ancient Hellbound, filled with evil spirits and possessing a malicious will of its own.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(5475, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 83', 'skillraid', 'This high-level Demon general, royalty even to the infernal, was ordered by  Darion to capture the Tower of Infinitum.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(5476, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 83', 'skillraid', 'Along with Darion, this Demon was involved in the alliance against Beleth and was particularly involved in Beleth\'s invasion of the mainland.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(5477, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 83', 'skillraid', 'Beleth\'s right hand, he designed the Iron Castle and created a number of powerful magical tools for his master. Because of his long association with the Demon, his soul has been irretrievably corrupted.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(5478, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 83', 'skillraid', 'The Chief Guard of the Crystal Caverns, selected because of his strength and power. It is his responsibility to keep an eye on the imprisoned Parme as well as represent all the Demons on the island.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
