(5614, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 87', 'skillraid', 'He was one of the Devil\'s retainers from Asmodae, and Beleth placed him among the people in order to rule Hellbound. Although he took over the power and turned Hellbound into the devil\'s territory after Beleth disappeared for magic experiments. Beleth does not really care about it.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
