(6062, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 81', 'skillraid', 'An evil undead version of the elder of twin knights who were famous warriors in Gracia before the fall. When both appear at the same time, their powers are enhanced.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(6063, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 81', 'skillraid', 'An evil undead version of the younger of twin knights who were famous warriors in Gracia before the fall. When both appear at the same time, their powers are enhanced.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(6064, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 81', 'skillraid', 'An undead version of a famous healer in Gracia before the fall. It served Ekimus and later aspired to rule the Hall of Erosion.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(6065, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 81', 'skillraid', 'An undead version of an infamous serial killer infamous throughout Gracia before the fall. He attempted to preserve his life by threatening Cohemenes, but was deceived and became an undead slave.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(6066, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 81', 'skillraid', 'Steals souls in order to secrete matter from the Seed of Infinity. These Soul Devourers eventually lose all capacity for thought, driven only by their unholy appetite. Thy particularly favor souls that suffered a horrific and agonizing death.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(6067, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 81', 'skillraid', 'An undead version of the royal astrologer in Gracia before the fall. While alive, his intentionally false prophecy opened the kingdom to the influence of Ekimus and the Seed of Infinity.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(6068, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 81', 'skillraid', 'An undead version of a former Gracian high priest. Obsessed with attaining eternal life, he played a pivotal role in bringing the Seed of Infinity to the capital. He styled himself the 1st priest of Ekimus.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(6069, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 81', 'skillraid', 'An exceptionally efficient pre-fall Gracian provincial official infamous for his brutal interrogation methods. He was transformed into undead by the Seed of Infinity.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(6070, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 81', 'skillraid', 'In his bid for power, he committed atrocities in Gracia rarely seen before the fall. Because of his thirst for violence and bloodshed, he was transformed into undead by the Seed of Infinity..', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(6071, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 81', 'skillraid', 'This undead monster was once a powerful warlord on the frontier of pre-fall Gracia. He believed that an enemy\'s power was contained in their blood, and so he killed countless prisoners in order to absorb their strength. He was transformed into undead by the Seed of Infinity.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(6072, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 81', 'skillraid', 'This undead monster was once once of the most powerful warlords in Gracia. He gained popularity among the fallen nobles for mercilessly carrying out his missions, whatever the cost. He was also a secret worshipper of the Goddess of Death.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(6073, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 81', 'skillraid', 'This undead monster was created from the rage and pain of prisoners tortured and killed in ancient Gracia.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(6074, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 81', 'skillraid', 'This undead monster was created to protect a sacred burial ground for nobles in ancient Gracia.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(6075, 1, 0, 'Raid Boss - Level 81', 'skillraid', 'This undead monster was created to prevent the corpses left on the battlefields of ancient Gracia from being raised.', 12, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
