(8193, 1, 0, 'Heavy Armor of Nightmare Set - PvP', 'armor_t80_ul_i00', 'Increases resistance to sleep/hold attacks and P. Atk. Decreases damage received during PvP and has a chance to decrease all the attacker\'s speeds. CON+2, DEX-2', 16, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(8194, 1, 0, 'Heavy Majestic Plate Armor Set - PvP', 'armor_t83_ul_i00', 'Increases resistance to shock attacks and P. Atk./accuracy. Decreases damage received during PvP and has a chance to decrease all the attacker\'s speeds. STR+2. CON-2', 16, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(8195, 1, 0, 'Light Nightmarish Leather Armor Set - PvP', 'armor_t81_ul_i00', 'Increases resistance to sleep/hold attacks and magic resistance. A portion of the damage inflicted on the enemy is used to recover one\'s own HP. Excludes damage caused by skills and long-range attacks. Decreases damage received during PvP and has a chance to cancel the opponent\'s target when being attacked. DEX+1, CON-1', 16, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(8196, 1, 0, 'Light Majestic Leather Armor Set - PvP', 'armor_t84_ul_i00', 'Increases resistance to shock attacks and bow or crossbow P. Atk./maximum MP/weight limit. Decreases damage received during PvP and has a chance to cancel the opponent\'s target when being attacked. DEX+1, CON-1', 16, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(8197, 1, 0, 'Nightmare Robe Set - PvP', 'armor_t82_ul_i00', 'Increases resistance to sleep/hold attacks and MP regeneration/magic power. Decreases damage received during PvP, and has a chance to decrease critical rate and critical damage when being attacked. INT+2, WIT-2', 16, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(8198, 1, 0, 'Majestic Robe Set - PvP', 'armor_t85_ul_i00', 'Increases resistance to shock attacks and increases Max MP, Casting Spd., and MP recovery bonus. Decreases damage received during PvP, and decreases the critical rate and critical damage at a certain rate when being attacked. MEN+1, INT-1', 16, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(8199, 1, 0, 'Heavy Imperial Crusader Breastplate Set - PvP', 'armor_t88_u_i00', 'Increases resistance to sleep/hold attacks and Max. HP/P. Def. Decreases damage received during PvP and has a chance to decrease all the attacker\'s speeds. STR+2, DEX-2', 16, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(8200, 1, 0, 'Light Draconic Leather Armor Set - PvP', 'armor_t89_ul_i00', 'Increases maximum MP/Atk. Spd./P. Atk./weight limit. Decreases damage received during PvP and has a chance to cancel the opponent\'s target when being attacked. DEX+1, STR+1, CON-2', 16, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
(8201, 1, 0, 'Major Arcana Robe Set - PvP', 'armor_t90_ul_i00', 'Decreases magic cancel rate, and increases resistance to shock attacks and magic power/speed/weight limit. Decreases damage received during PvP, and has a chance to decrease critical rate and critical damage when being attacked. WIT+1, INT+1, MEN-2', 16, 0, 0, 0, -2, 0, 0, 0, '', 0),
